WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.920
Someone once said...

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:55.460
There are butterflies made of winged,

00:01:55.460 --> 00:02:00.060
first-rate, piping hot fishcakes, 
deep-fried to a beautiful brown...

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:05.330
Butterfried Fishcakes!

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:14.440
When you squeeze the udders of this 
buffalo, out comes refreshing, top quality

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:15.640
soda water...

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:19.450
Soda Water Buffalo!

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:25.350
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:31.090
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:38.900
Toriko and Zebra reached the Great 
Pyramid at last in their quest

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:41.530
to capture Mellow Cola and rescue Komatsu.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:47.070
However, the Pyramid itself was no more 
than a corner of an enormous structure.

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:53.910
Komatsu arrived inside the 
Gourmet Pyramid first,

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.950
carried along on a current of quicksand.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:00.150
There, he was attacked by Beasts, but 
protected by Zebra's Howl Bullets.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.860
Then, while fighting the Beasts,

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:06.460
Toriko and Zebra pressed 
on, heading ever downward.

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.700
15-fold Spiked Punch!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.670
Take this!

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:32.050
But Zebra lost his voice due to exhaustion,

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:35.820
and the Echo Map turned off, making 
them lose track of Komatsu.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.320
Meanwhile, Komatsu found a track

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:43.230
that looked similar to the one left 
by a creature he saw in Vegetable Sky.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.500
Astounding!

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:51.600
The Mysterious Ancient Manuscript 
and the Creature Inside the Coffin!

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:04.280
Th-This footprint... Could it be...

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:08.520
...made by that creature 
we saw in Vegetable Sky?!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:42.890
Three-headed Unicorn 
meat... is kinda tough...

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:45.620
And I don't think it has 
much nutritional value...

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:49.120
Still, 1 kilogram has 1,000 kilocalories,

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.790
about the same as the white 
meat on a chicken, right?

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:56.030
Have you recovered a little, Zebra?

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.470
Not at all?!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:04.110
You must've eaten at least 100,000 
kilocalories worth of meat.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.510
Thank you for the meat.

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:18.350
The amount of energy I can amass...

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.720
...is about 3 million kilocalories.

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:24.260
The max amount of energy Zebra can hold...

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.890
...is approximately 4 million, 
500,000 kilocalories.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.800
That's the highest of the Four Kings.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.300
If it's just physical strength,

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:35.240
all he needs is enough food 
to restore himself quickly.

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:38.340
But once Zebra loses his voice,

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.870
it takes time before he can get it back.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:43.680
Zebra!

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.010
You remember the map's route, don't you?

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:48.920
I'm relying on you to guide us.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.550
"Shut up and follow me..."?

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:56.320
I remember your weird, original hand signals

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.390
from when you used to lose 
your voice a long time ago.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.290
You never change.

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:10.770
What? It's a wall.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.170
We should smash through it?

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:16.880
3-fold Spiked Punch!

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:25.620
Hidden stairs!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.190
Hang in there, Komatsu!

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:47.170
Jowlcargot (Mollusk Beast) Capture Level 38

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.250
W-What is...

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.680
Hey, kid...

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.820
This is the last time you'll be 
able to hear my voice for a while,

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:05.420
so if you miss a single word, I'll kill you!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.990
Z-Zebra-san!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.430
Because I shielded you with Sound Armor,

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:15.230
I lost my voice.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.730
So listen good...

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.500
Alright!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.110
Think of everything as ingredients.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:26.380
You're a cook. You'll see how to use them.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.210
I see...

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:31.510
This Beast is an ingredient...

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:39.120
Melk knife...

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:49.870
I'm gonna... I'm gonna...

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:51.770
...prepare it!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:06.950
I'm gonna...

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:10.690
...prepare this ingredient!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.900
What was that? Did something 
happen to Komatsu?

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:29.970
What's wrong, Zebra?

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.280
Something's coming!

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.010
What are they?!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:44.120
Dangol (Carapace Beast) Capture Level 40

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.090
How many are there?!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.890
Flying Fork!

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:55.760
That used up 30,000 kilocalories!

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.840
W-Water?

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.140
Oh, no.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:07.740
I might have caused the water underneath 
the desert to come into the pyramid...

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:12.550
Just how sharp is my Melk knife?!

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:17.420
I'd better not use it anywhere 
other than in a kitchen.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.090
Now where am I?

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:41.870
The path splits...

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:43.780
This again...

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:48.080
That's right. At a time 
like this, I should use...

00:09:59.220 --> 00:09:59.990
This way!

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:05.700
Huh?

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:09.970
Another fork in the path...

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.700
So I'll just...

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.210
This way...

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:24.680
What's this?

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.750
I guess the only thing 
to do is check it out...

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:44.770
Monoclops (Reptilian Beast) Capture Level 45

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:56.980
So this also tells me where the Beasts are...

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:14.200
C-Coffins?!

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:18.070
Even now, nobody has gotten to the truth.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:22.440
According to legends, the king of an 
ancient nation lies sleeping in there

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:25.410
or there's some legendary 
ingredient hidden in there...

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.810
Maybe in one of these...

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.380
I can't do it! I don't wanna see any mummy!

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:53.330
W-What's this room?!

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:16.360
W-What's this room?!

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.200
What the heck are these 
paintings on the wall?!

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:37.340
What the...?!

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:07.640
This is...

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:27.260
More tough meat! Well, Zebra?!

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.700
Zebra! You...

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:43.740
Don't tell me that one you 
had just now was delicious?!

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:46.610
It was delicious, wasn't it?!

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:50.680
Is it possible that just 
one was tasty?! I dunno...

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:55.150
For my energy,

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.950
I got about 800,000 kilocalories back.

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:00.260
From what I could see,

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.630
Zebra's still just at 350,000 kilocalories...

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:40.730
Tiger Fang (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 35

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:43.930
This one looks like it'll be pretty tough.

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:45.830
Looks tasty...

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:19.270
The Sound Armor that Zebra-san 
put around me is weakening!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.940
This thing's attacks are too strong!

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.170
I have to get away!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:39.650
Now's my chance!

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:45.090
That book...

00:15:56.700 --> 00:16:00.210
"Let's hurry ahead..."? Gotcha.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:08.150
What the...? This part's 
really tender and tasty!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.990
We ate a lot there...

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:24.430
I'm up to 2,200,000 kilocalories.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.500
And Zebra's probably recovered 
about 900,000 kilocalories.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:35.210
Mimic Bagworm (Insect Beast) Capture Level 12

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.580
Flying Knife!

00:16:55.690 --> 00:17:00.960
I give thanks for this world's bounty.

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:07.200
Yes! I got a good one!

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:09.810
It's tender and delicious!

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:15.310
Now my energy is up to 
2,400,000 kilocalories.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:19.580
Zebra should be up to 1,800,000 kilocalories.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:35.230
Evil Hunter (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 40

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.230
Spiked Punch!

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:47.540
Back to the tough stuff!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:54.120
But this brings my energy 
to 2,550,000 kilocalories.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:58.350
Zebra's up to 3,600,000 now.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:17.100
Now that was worth eating!

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:34.090
I finally got my voice back.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.160
Zebra!

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:40.090
Our energy is just about full up, huh?

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.930
Is Komatsu alright?!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.560
Pray he is.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.870
Echo Map!

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.020
This ain't good...

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:12.660
Kid! Don't go that way!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.760
Zebra-san!

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.070
Dishing with Tina!

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:35.070
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:38.470
Today, we're going to be playing 
a game called Treating Table.

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.910
And my opponent for this game is...

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:47.680
Gourmet Hunter, Bonbe

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.150
...Gourmet Hunter, Bonbe!

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:46.520
That's right. My name is Bonbe.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:50.350
No, it's <i>Zonge</i>! How many 
times do I have to tell you?!

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:52.620
Gourmet Hunter, Zonge

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.890
I'm Gourmet Hunter, Zonge!

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.490
If you screw around with me,

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:57.660
I'll change the name of this 
show to "Dishin' with Zonge"!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:59.600
Okay, let's begin!

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.200
Tch! What, you ignorin' me?!

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:03.370
Let's start Treating Table!

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:08.140
First, I'll explain the rules.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.170
The person who chooses the one 
dish on the Treating Table

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:13.740
that's closest to 100,000 yen is the winner.

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:17.950
And the loser has to pay 
for both players' dishes!

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:20.580
I didn't hear about that!

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.050
They told you before...

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:24.090
Either way,

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:28.390
challenging a mega-ultra-super national 
treasure class Gourmet Hunter like me

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:30.730
to a game like this,

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:34.960
you got guts, lady!

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.860
Alright, I'm going to go with...

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:39.500
...this delicious-looking tart!

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.710
It's a heaping helping of deliciousness!

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:49.340
Obviously an amateur!

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:52.050
I'll take this!

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:54.280
Uh... a boiled egg?!

00:21:54.280 --> 00:21:57.050
It looks like a normal boiled egg,

00:21:57.050 --> 00:21:59.320
but it can't fool me!

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:01.550
This is a first-class ingredient!

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:05.330
A Gourmet Hunter like me ain't 
gonna fall for no two-bit trap!

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:07.130
That's our Zonge-sama!

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:14.030
This mellow taste, this yellow springiness,

00:22:14.030 --> 00:22:17.800
and a super-first-rate taste that 
makes me think of foie gras...

00:22:17.800 --> 00:22:20.770
This is definitely 100,000 
yen worth of deliciousness!

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:23.640
My tongue isn't mistaken!

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:24.980
Bravo!

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:27.210
Alright, I'll announce the results.

00:22:27.580 --> 00:22:29.520
The person who's going to pay up is...

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:37.390
That was fast! Why?!

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:40.430
Tina chose a golden pear tart

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:41.930
that's 110,000 yen!

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.260
Zonge-san chose an average hardboiled egg

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:47.430
worth 50 yen!

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:51.070
This is a complete loss of 
face for a Gourmet Hunter...

00:22:52.570 --> 00:22:55.070
Your bill is 110,050 yen.

00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:57.080
Like I can pay that?!

00:22:57.080 --> 00:22:59.340
I thought that was a regular hardboiled egg!

00:22:59.340 --> 00:23:00.850
It's okay to put it on a credit card.

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:03.110
All I've got is a Toriko card!

00:23:02.050 --> 00:23:04.720
Let's move on to the next segment.

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:09.220
At 92, it has the highest Capture Level on record.

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:11.860
Toriko and Zebra fight to retrieve the Mellow Cola!

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:13.720
Let the battle begin!

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.960
Shocking Showdown! Salamander Sphinx!

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:18.680
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
